# The Tier-1 sandbox helper binaries are prebuilt on Windows CI, Authenticode-
# signed, and packed into the npm tarball at publish time (the package `files`
# allowlist includes `vendor/`). They are deliberately NOT committed to git: the
# repo must never carry an unsigned or unreviewed native binary, and a local
# `cargo build` drop (for verification) must not be pushed by accident.
# See docs/cortex/windows-sandbox-build.md.
win32-x64/*.exe
win32-arm64/*.exe
